      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 113.0,
        "t": 370.87,
        "r": 527.5600000000004,
        "b": 345.7
      },
      "content": "▲ Align the connector on the replacement eMMC (callout 1) with the connector on the formatter, and then push the eMMC onto the formatter to install it."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0323",
      "reading_order": 386,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 134.99996,
        "t": 333.79,
        "r": 538.8800000000001,
        "b": 310.2
      },
      "content": "IMPORTANT: Push on the eMMC at the location shown by the arrow. Ignore any 'Push here' label on the eMMC itself. Make sure that the eMMC is fully seated in the connector ."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0324",
      "reading_order": 387,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 135.0,
        "t": 300.79,
        "r": 426.95999999999987,
        "b": 289.2
      },
      "content": "NOTE: The eMMC can only be installed in one direction on the formatter."
    },
